Scope: 5 quests (Spirits of the Elid, Temple of the Eye, The Golem, The Tourist Trap, Prince Ali Rescue), all in the Desert region. 137 atoms total (28+25+33+35+16) across 19 checkpoints, all contributed fresh (no duplicate-key skips, no concurrent-dispatch collision this time). Zero pre-existing questatoms:* keys for any of the 5 quest ids at session start.
