Coords: only Spirits of the Elid has any {{Map}} template on its quick guide (1 pin); the other 4 quests have zero coordinate data available, not a fetch gap.
Canonical trigger for next wave: when a task briefs "5 quests" from a shared region/wave, check manifest.jsonl coverage BEFORE budgeting get-calls -- a fully pre-cached wave (like this one) means the whole 5-get-per-quest budget is unnecessary and research time should go straight to atomization/schema care instead.
