[media-capture] fishing spots (and rod-fishing spots) are NPCs in the rev-236 cache, not locs — a grep over locs/<region>.json.gz for "Fishing spot"/"Rod Fishing spot" object ids will always come back empty even at a real fishing location; the correct lookup is npc-spawns/<region>.json.gz (npcs.pack ids 42/394/635/1497-1519 etc., actions=["Lure","Bait"]/["Net","Bait"]/etc.). train-fishing-40's own pre-existing mapMarker (3078,3429, Barbarian Village) has no matching fishing-spot NPC within a 20-tile radius on either lookup path — likely stale, left un-grounded rather than guessed.
