[media-capture] some iconic/multi-appearance NPCs (Turael, Wise Old Man) have a real wiki {{Map}} coordinate and known cache ids but do NOT appear anywhere in their region's static npc-spawns/<region>.json.gz snapshot (checked all known appearance-variant ids, both planes) — likely spawned via script/quest-state logic rather than the static per-region spawn table. Don't assume "has a wiki id + wiki coordinate" is sufficient grounding for a native scenario; cross-check the STATIC spawn snapshot too, and skip (don't guess a placement tile) if it's absent, same discipline as an unconfirmable loc.
